==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|lykill}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlɪːcɪtl/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ɪːcɪtl|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|lykils|lyklar}}

# a [[key]]
#: ''Ekki gleyma '''lyklunum''' þegar þú ferð út.''
#:: Don't forget '''the keys''' on your way out.
#: ''Ég hef þrjá '''lykla''' og [[tyggjó]] í vasanum.''
#:: I have three '''keys''' and some [[gum]] in my pocket.
# {{lb|is|music}} a [[clef]]
# {{lb|is|computing}} a [[key]]; one of several small, usually square buttons on a typewriter or computer keyboard{{jump|is|computer key|s}}
# {{lb|is|cryptography}} a [[cryptographic key]], a [[key]]

